==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|ru|терпѣ́ть||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*(s)ter-}}
{{inh+|ru|orv|тьрпѣти}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*tьrpěti}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|терпе́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-терпеть.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|терпе́ть|impf|pf=потерпе́ть|vn=терпе́ние<q:nomen actionis>,терпёж<q:nomen actionis>,терпи́ла<q:nomen agentis>,терпёжник<q:nomen agentis>,терпе́лец<q:nomen experietis>,терпи́мец<q:nomen experientis>,терпе́лка<q:nomen instrumenti et obiecti>}}

# to [[endure]], to [[suffer]], to [[tolerate]], to [[stand]]
#: {{ux|ru|[[наш|На́ша]] [[кома́нда]] '''те́рпит''' [[пораже́ние]].|Our team is being defeated.|lit=Our team '''is suffering''' a defeat.}}
#: {{ux|ru|'''Терпе́ть''' [[не]] [[мочь|могу́]] [[этот|э́того]] [[человек|челове́ка]]!|I cannot '''stand''' that person!}}
# to [[undergo]] (a change, ''especially'' a negative one)
# to [[hold it]], to wait for [[opportunity]] to [[urinate]] or [[defecate]] despite physical [[urge]]

